<h3>Modes</h3>

<p>
Summary of the impact of the modes. The tests in the <code>general</code> mode are run by default;
the tests in the other modes are only run when the mode is passed to the runner:
</p>

<table class="grid">
  <tr>
   <td><b>Mode</b></td>
   <td><b>Suites (test count)</b></td>
   <td><b>Tests</b></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>general</td>
    <td><i>(all the suites that are not marked with another mode)</i></td>
    <td>{{ $this.suites.where(mode.count() = 0 or mode = 'general').tests.where(mode.count() = 0 or mode = 'general').count() }}</td>
  </tr>
{% for m in ($this.suites.mode | $this.suites.tests.mode).distinct().where($this != 'general') %}
  <tr>
    <td>{{ m }}</td>
    <td>{% for s in $this.suites.where(mode = %m) %}{{ s.name }} ({{ s.tests.count() }})<br/>
    {% endfor %}{% for s in $this.suites.where((mode.count() = 0 or mode != %m) and tests.where(mode = %m).count() > 0) %}{{ s.name }} ({{ s.tests.where(mode = %m).count() }} of {{ s.tests.count() }})<br/>
    {% endfor %}</td>
    <td>{{ $this.suites.where(mode = %m).tests.count() + $this.suites.where(mode.count() = 0 or mode != %m).tests.where(mode = %m).count() }}</td>
  </tr>
{% endfor %}
  <tr>
    <td><b>Total</b></td>
    <td><i>{{ $this.suites.count() }} suites</i></td>
    <td><b>{{ $this.suites.tests.count() }}</b></td>
  </tr>
</table>

<h3>Suites</h3>

<p>
The flags say when a suite runs: its mode (only when that mode is passed to the runner), the features the
server must declare, the FHIR version, and whether its tests must run in order. Disabled suites are struck out.
</p>

<table class="grid">
  <tr>
   <td><b>Name</b></td>
   <td><b>Flags</b></td>
   <td><b>Description</b></td>
  </tr>
{% for suite in $this.suites %}
  <tr {% if suite.disabled %} style="opacity: 0.5; text-decoration: line-through" {% endif %}>
    <td>{{ suite.name }}</td>
    <td>{{ suite.mode }}{% if suite.feature %} feature: {{ suite.feature }}{% endif %}{% if suite.version %} version: {{ suite.version }}{% endif %}{% if suite.sequential %} sequential{% endif %}</td>
    <td>{{ suite.description || markdownify}}</td>
   </tr>
{% endfor %}
</table>

<h3>Tests</h3>


<table class="grid">
  <tr>
   <td><b>Name</b></td>
   <td><b>Operation</b></td>
   <td><b>Flags</b></td>
   <td><b>Description</b></td>
  </tr>
{% for suite in $this.suites %}
  <tr {% if suite.disabled %} style="background-color: #eeeeee; opacity: 0.5; text-decoration: line-through" {% else %} style="background-color: #eeeeee" {% endif %}>
    <td colspan="2">{{ suite.name }}</td>
    <td>{{ suite.mode }}{% if suite.feature %} feature: {{ suite.feature }}{% endif %}{% if suite.version %} version: {{ suite.version }}{% endif %}{% if suite.sequential %} sequential{% endif %}</td>
    <td>
      {{ suite.description || markdownify}}
      {% if suite.notes %}
      <br/>
      {{ suite.notes}}
      {% endif %}
    </td>
   </tr>

  {% for test in suite.tests %}
   <tr {% if suite.disabled or test.disabled %} style="opacity: 0.5; text-decoration: line-through" {% endif %}>
    <td>{{ test.name }}</td>
    <td>${{ test.operation }}</td>
    <td>{{ test.mode}}{% if test.feature %} feature: {{ test.feature }}{% endif %}{% if test.version %} version: {{ test.version }}{% endif %}</td>
    <td>{{ test.description || markdownify}}</td>
   </tr>
  {% endfor %}
{% endfor %}
</table>
